      "message": "Moving the check before the D-Bus write fixes my earlier concern, but its Looking like there\u0027s no rollback now.\n\naddUserToNonIpmiGroupUsers() reserves a slot, then setDbusProperty() runs. That function is void and reports failure by throwing (utils.hpp), and it isn\u0027t in a try/catch here. If it throws, the groups were never changed on D-Bus — but the slot stays reserved. No signal fires, so removeUserFromNoneIpmiGroupUsers() never runs. Same for the getUserInfo() and writeUserData() error returns.\n\n15 failed attempts would exhaust the pool with zero non-IPMI users present, until ipmid restarts.\n\nPlease Correct me if My understanding Wrong ?",
