      "side": 1,
      "message": "Fixed in PS18: setDbusProperty is now wrapped in try/catch. If it throws, the groups were never changed on D-Bus, so the slot reserved just before the call is released via removeUserFromNoneIpmiGroupUsers() and ccUnspecifiedError is returned. The release is guarded — it only happens when this call actually inserted the entry, so a user who was already in listNoneIpmiGroupUsers (already non-IPMI) keeps their valid entry if a later group change fails.\n\n\ngetUserInfo()/writeUserData() failures need no rollback: they occur after setDbusProperty succeeded, so the user\u0027s groups really changed and the list entry is accurate. Reconciliation for actual group changes is handled by the PropertiesChanged signal path; removing the entry here would only fight that.",
